================================================================================================
(a) PRIMARY ENDPOINT — accuracy BEFORE recourse vs AFTER the judgment audit
================================================================================================
The population is every debate cell the source tree decided and this run
contested, carrying a dataset label. A cell's after-state is the ruling's
verdict where the contest produced a ruling and the decision's own otherwise.

                               AFTER correct       AFTER wrong     total
