================================================================================================
Same cells, same third-party recourse judge (openai/gpt-4.1-nano), same
corrected ruling line. What differs is the QUESTION the challenger was asked:
the neutral arm re-decides the item, this one audits the judgment against the
record. A neutral cell nobody objected to keeps its before-state, which is the
